<section class="about" data-motion-section="about">
<div class="wrap about-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow" style="color:#1766c7">Licensing &amp; Credentials</div>
<h2>Daniel Larson Training</h2>
<p>Daniel Larson authors and produces the course materials, records the explainers, and answers student questions directly. Daniel Larson Training is a Florida-focused real estate school built around one thing: helping students understand the material well enough to get through licensing and move on.</p>
<p>If you studied with Daniel years ago, were referred by a broker, or simply found the school online, you get the same course system and the same direct line to the instructor.</p>
</div>
<aside class="proofbox">
<div><b>Florida Licensed Real Estate School</b>#ZH1002860</div>
<div><b>Florida Real Estate Instructor</b>Daniel Larson · #ZH1003217</div>
<div><b>Course authorship</b>Courses authored and produced by Daniel Larson and approved by the Florida DBPR for their applicable education requirements.</div>
<div><b>Direct contact</b><a href="sms:+12394718500">239.471.8500</a> · <a href="mailto:daniel@daniellarsontraining.com">daniel@daniellarsontraining.com</a></div>
</aside>
</div>
</section>
<section class="faq" data-motion-section="faq" id="faq">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="eyebrow" style="color:#1766c7">COURSE + FASTPASS Q&amp;A</div>
<h2>Florida Real Estate Licensing FAQ</h2>
</div>
<div class="faq-list">
<details><summary>How much do the sales licensing packages cost?</summary><p>{pricingAnswer}</p></details>
<details><summary>What is included in the FastPass package?</summary><p>FastPass is ${salePrice(products.salesFastPass)} with code <strong>{products.salesFastPass.couponCode}</strong>, saving ${products.salesFastPass.discountAmount} from the regular ${products.salesFastPass.price}. The package includes the DBPR-approved 63-hour Course 1, three FastPass certification exams, Exam Math Basics, 500+ practice questions and explanations, audio ebook review, the FastPass Workbook online and as a PDF, one year of access, and direct support from Daniel.</p></details>
<details><summary>How is FastPass different?</summary><p>FastPass uses three certification exams in place of the traditional course final exam. Test out when you’re ready, with the full Course 1, Exam Math Basics, audio ebook review, and 500+ Q&amp;A with explanations available to help you prepare. The Florida state licensing exam is separate.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does FastPass replace the Florida state licensing exam?</summary><p>No. The Florida state licensing exam is a separate exam administered by <a href="https://www.pearsonvue.com/us/en/fl/dbpr.html" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pearson Professional Assessments</a> (formerly Pearson VUE). FastPass is preparation and part of the course-certification path; you still take the state exam separately.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long do I have access?</summary><p>Course bundles include one year of online access.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I contact the owner directly?</summary><p>Yes. You can text the owner directly at <a href="sms:+12394718500">239.471.8500</a> or email <a href="mailto:daniel@daniellarsontraining.com">daniel@daniellarsontraining.com</a> about the course, exam preparation, or your licensing steps.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do I need printed course books?</summary><p>{booksAnswer}</p></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="finalcta" data-motion-section="finalcta">
